    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">compiles the GNN model into a low- and tile-level program</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">incorporating the overhead of NVSHMEM remote memory access in the runtime prediction model when optimizing partitioning strategies online.</hasEvidenceText>
