    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Edge Cut serves as the primary large-scale graph partitioning approach in popular graph machine learning packages</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Edge Cut serves as the primary large-scale graph partitioning approach in popular graph machine learning packages [ 5 , 25 ] and is widely combined with the METIS algorithm</hasEvidenceText>
