    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">message-passing systems [ 22 , 31 , 59 ] divide graph convolution into two stages: message and reduce , where users create messages as edge tensors and conduct aggregation using tensor reduction operations.</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">message-passing systems [ 22 , 31 , 59 ] divide graph convolution into two stages: message and reduce , where users create messages as edge tensors</hasEvidenceText>
