    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Sparse Matrix-Matrix multiplication (SpMM) is a fundamental operator in GNNs, which performs a multiplication operation between a sparse matrix and a dense matrix.</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
