    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">AES = 1 # E ( src id , trg id ) E | src id trg id | (4) where E is the edge set of the graph</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
