    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">GraphNet (Battaglia et al., 2018) and AliGraph (Zhu et al., 2019) are two TensorFlow packages for building GNN models.</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
